# Pharmacy receipt → POS pack size (do not regress)

Cashier «В УП.» reads `product_attributes.units_in_pack`, not the receipt line.

## Invariants

1. On **post** (`PharmacyReceiptActivation`) and **posted mass/line sync** (`PharmacyReceiptPostedPriceSync`), copy line `unitsInPack` into product attribute `units_in_pack` via `ProductAttributeService.upsertAttribute` (do not wipe other attributes).
2. Keep syncing cost / retail / VAT as today; pack size is additional, not instead of prices.
3. Dark POS cart price edit input must use `--pharm-cell-bg` / `--pharm-ink` (never hardcoded white bg + `color: inherit`).

## Do not

- Assume changing only `stock_receipt_lines.units_in_pack` updates the cashier table.
- Call `saveAttributes` (full replace) just to set pack size.
